<title>USA: PGA GOLF-SATURDAY'S SCORES FROM ARIZONA.</title>
<headline>PGA GOLF-SATURDAY'S SCORES FROM ARIZONA.</headline>
<dateline>SCOTTSDALE, Arizona 1997-01-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Semi-final scores at the $3.65 million Andersen Consulting World Championship of golf played on the 6973-yard, par-72 Grayhawk course on Saturday:</p>
<p>Greg Norman (Australia) beat Hisayuki Sasaki (Japan) 5 and 4 Scott Hoch (U.S.) beat Sam Torrance (Britain) 4 and 2.</p>
</text>
